    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense. but sometimes it feels a bit abstract when you're just looking at a diagram. is there a way to visualize it more? like, if you had to describe the actual movement of the air particles or the way the wing interacts with the air in a more \"active\" way, how would you put it?",
